Modifications made by Katharina Kampa (2026):

  - Added sequence perturbation logic (`perturb_sequence`) to generate an
    ensemble of mutated variants of the input protein sequence.
  - Extended the prediction pipeline to run AlphaFold across the perturbed
    sequence ensemble and aggregate results (mean, variance, percentile
    intervals).
  - Added loading and parsing of a reference structure from a PDB file via
    Biopython.
  - Added evaluation code computing Mean Absolute Error (MAE), Root Mean
    Square Error (RMSE), confidence interval width, prediction variance,
    coverage and Concordance Correlation Coefficient (CCC) against the
    reference structure. See the README ("Known issues") for limitations of
    this evaluation.
  - Added corresponding visualizations.

